---
---
<section class="across-ecosystem-section">
  <div class="container ecosystem-container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">Peer implementations</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Across the OPC UA ecosystem.</h2>
      <p class="section-lead">
        node-opcua is one of a small handful of production-grade OPC UA stacks the industry actually runs on.
        The others are excellent choices for the layers below and beside it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="ecosystem-content">
      <ul class="peer-list">
        <li class="peer-item">
          <span class="peer-lang">C / C++</span>
          <span class="peer-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          <span class="peer-link-wrapper">
            <a href="https://www.open62541.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="peer-link">open62541</a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="peer-item">
          <span class="peer-lang">Java</span>
          <span class="peer-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          <span class="peer-link-wrapper">
            <a href="https://github.com/eclipse-milo/milo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="peer-link">Eclipse Milo</a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="peer-item">
          <span class="peer-lang">.NET / C#</span>
          <span class="peer-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          <span class="peer-link-wrapper">
            <a href="https://github.com/OPCFoundation/UA-.NETStandard" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="peer-link">OPC Foundation UA-.NETStandard</a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="peer-item">
          <span class="peer-lang">Python</span>
          <span class="peer-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          <span class="peer-link-wrapper">
            <a href="https://github.com/FreeOpcUa/opcua-asyncio" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="peer-link">asyncua</a>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="peer-item">
          <span class="peer-lang">Rust</span>
          <span class="peer-arrow">&rarr;</span>
          <span class="peer-link-wrapper">
            <a href="https://github.com/locka99/opcua" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="peer-link">rust-opcua</a>
            <span class="peer-note">(community project)</span>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="body-p peer-note-line">
        Sterfive participates in the OPC Foundation alongside the maintainers of these projects.
        Interoperability is the point.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .across-ecosystem-section {
    padding: var(--space-section-lg) 0;
    background-color: var(--bg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider);
  }
  .ecosystem-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .section-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-stack-xs);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-stack-xl);
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--ink);
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .section-lead {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    max-width: 56ch;
    margin-top: var(--space-stack-xs);
  }
  .peer-note-line {
    margin-top: var(--space-stack-md);
    padding-top: var(--space-stack-md);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--divider);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }
  .ecosystem-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-stack-md);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .body-p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .figure-emphasis {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .peer-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: var(--space-stack-xs) 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content 1.5rem 1fr;
    row-gap: 0.5rem;
    column-gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
  }
  .peer-item {
    display: contents;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .peer-lang {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .peer-arrow {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .peer-link-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .peer-link {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .peer-link:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
  }
  .peer-note {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  
  @media (max-width: 767px) {
    .body-p {
      font-size: 1.0625rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }
  }
</style>
